4,"r5_spy":-0.0887,"r20_spy":0.0016}}],"quotes":[{"c":"MOH 2018 Q3","e":"moh","d":"2018-11-01","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Joseph Zubretsky","x":"Since the beginning of the year, we have reduced our headcount by more than 600 physicians or over 5% of our workforce.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2018/11/01/molina-healthcare-inc-moh-q3-2018-earnings-confere.aspx"},{"c":"MOH 2018 Q3","e":"moh","d":"2018-11-01","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Joseph Zubretsky","x":"Second, we have continued to streamline our management ranks and manage bands of control.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2018/11/01/molina-healthcare-inc-moh-q3-2018-earnings-confere.aspx"},{"c":"MOH 2018 Q3","e":"moh","d":"2018-11-01","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Thomas Tran","x":"We have raised our full year guidance to a range of $8.80 to $9 per diluted share, an increase of $1.65 on a GAAP basis and an increase of $2.60 on the pure performance basis at the midpoint from our previous guidance issue on August 1st.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2018/11/01/molina-healthcare-inc-moh-q3-2018-earnings-confere.aspx"},{"c":"MOH 2018 Q4","e":"moh","d":"2019-02-12","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Joseph Zubretsky","x":"We reduced our headcount by more than 800 FTEs, or nearly 7% from the beginning of the year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/02/12/molina-healthcare-inc-moh-q4-2018-earnings-confere.aspx"},{"c":"MOH 2018 Q4","e":"moh","d":"2019-02-12","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Thomas Tran","x":"Specifically, we recorded a $52 million pre-tax loss on the sale of our Pathways subsidiary. $8 million of restructuring expenses, primarily related to costs associated with our ongoing IT restructuring plan.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/02/12/molina-healthcare-inc-moh-q4-2018-earnings-confere.aspx"},{"c":"MOH 2019 Q1","e":"moh","d":"2019-04-30","l":"prici