ected in prior-year period development, which we do not forecast, and…","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/07/31/molina-healthcare-inc-moh-q2-2019-earnings-call-tr.aspx"},{"c":"MOH 2019 Q3","e":"moh","d":"2019-10-30","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Thomas Tran","x":"So I think what you refer until we, is there any sort of restructuring costs or any kind of gain loss on convertible if that's what you were referring to.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/10/30/molina-healthcare-inc-moh-q3-2019-earnings-call-tr.aspx"},{"c":"MOH 2019 Q4","e":"moh","d":"2020-02-11","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Joseph Zubretsky","x":"And I think where we misforecasted was the result of members moving as prices were moving up, as price increases were going into the market, members would move for $10 and $20.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/02/11/molina-healthcare-inc-moh-q4-2019-earnings-call-tr.aspx"},{"c":"MOH 2019 Q4","e":"moh","d":"2020-02-11","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Thomas Tran","x":"Now, I wouldn't necessarily multiply that by 3 to get the full year impact, because you just can't take the cost out fast enough.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/02/11/molina-healthcare-inc-moh-q4-2019-earnings-call-tr.aspx"},{"c":"MOH 2019 Q4","e":"moh","d":"2020-02-11","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Thomas Tran","x":"In one quarter, you're not going to take cost out fast enough.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/02/11/molina-healthcare-inc-moh-q4-2019-earnings-call-tr.aspx"},{"c":"MOH 2020 Q1","e":"moh","d":"2020-05-01","l":"pricing_power","r":"analyst","s":"Josh Raskin","x":"And just one quick call on the revenue guidance, is there an assumption of pass-through revenues that are going to be coming through?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/05/01/molina-healthcare-inc-moh-q1-2020-earnings-call-tr.aspx"},{"c":"